Z||000000||Eric||06-04-2001||06:52 PM||||I haven't heard too much about the Vintage GP/ car show at Mid-Ohio this year.  Would I need to order advanced tickets or can I just show up?  Is anyone else going June 24?||||reg||1
Z||000001||rogergarrison||06-05-2001||08:16 AM||||a lot of my club members are going. A few of us are spending at least sat nite in the campground. Im taking my minivan, car on dolly and prob a new toy. You can buy daily or weekend pass at the track. All for us is dependent on weather of course. (not going if current rain keeps coming, it would be a mud bog.)<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||ChadMan||06-05-2001||08:57 AM||||I can't go...I'll be on vacation.  You don't need to order advance tickets, but if several Fieroholics want to go and park together, somebody is going to have to contact Steve Bidlack (PR guy at Mid-Ohio) and request a Fiero-only corral.  Otherwise, you guys will be in the "Miscellaneous" area with the MR2's.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||Eric||06-05-2001||10:28 AM||||I really would go just to see the racing.  I thought this was some kind of big Fiero show, but I guess COFE's deal is going on the same weekend.  <P>On a side note, there's a big Cobra replica show in London, OH also on the same weekend.  Since my dad's cobra won't be done by the event, I think I may only go to it one day, either Saturday or Sunday.  Okay, I'm about to be overloaded here  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  There's an autocross on that Sunday too.  What should I do?  I need a time machine.||||reg||1
Z||000004||rogergarrison||06-05-2001||04:11 PM||||just gotta put your priorities in order. The Vintage Races are 3 days long, practice Friday and saturday, Finals Sunday. There only here once a year, I could go to Fiero/Car shows every other weekend.<P>You have to give 30days prior notice for a corral unless they have extra space, which usually dont happen.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 06-05-2001).]||||reg||1
